{"id":275100,"shortDescription":"Ponte en la piel de un poderoso lince y recorre vastos paisajes naturales. Da a luz a tus cachorros, críalos y perfecciona tus habilidades de caza para ayudarlos a crecer fuertes. Explora la belleza salvaje de la naturaleza e intenta preparar a tu familia para hacer frente a las criaturas que habitan la gélida tundra.","developers":["Might and Delight"],"publishers":["Might and Delight"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"9 MAR 2015","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/275100?t=1762857307","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/275100/ss_05fa641f5894d40b84d4147f431c097840b9f9e0.600x338.jpg?t=1762857307","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/275100/ss_05fa641f5894d40b84d4147f431c097840b9f9e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762857307"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/275100/ss_0c5b0a731a12b5cb993fd3efff4a872ab6cb568e.600x338.jpg?t=1762857307","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/275100/ss_0c5b0a731a12b5cb993fd3efff4a872ab6cb568e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762857307"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/275100/ss_1d95283f5f4d8bb978a7cfe9af74bff42daf87be.600x338.jpg?t=1762857307","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/275100/ss_1d95283f5f4d8bb978a7cfe9af74bff42daf87be.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762857307"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/275100/ss_f5ef0aaa67549f2140a4a4381e0f808ff8e96695.600x338.jpg?t=1762857307","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/275100/ss_f5ef0aaa67549f2140a4a4381e0f808ff8e96695.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762857307"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/27510